{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05264","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮屠应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮屠应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出豫乘秋节，登高陟梵宫。\n皇心满尘界，佛迹现虚空。\n日月宜长寿，人天得大通。\n喜闻题宝偈，受记莫由同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}